WEBVTT

1
00:00:33.625 --> 00:00:36.916
In Chapter 16, Lord Krishna had explained

2
00:00:36.916 --> 00:00:40.541
that those who abandon the
boundaries of scripture,

3
00:00:40.541 --> 00:00:43.083
being controlled by desire, attain

4
00:00:43.083 --> 00:00:46.500
neither success nor peace.

5
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:49.000
Now in this first verse

6
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.416
of Chapter 17, Arjun first says –

7
00:00:51.416 --> 00:00:54.666
a person who ignores scripture

8
00:00:54.666 --> 00:00:57.791
is not driven by desire alone.

9
00:00:57.791 --> 00:01:01.750
Some people worship with sincerity and faith,

10
00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:03.083
but their practice

11
00:01:03.083 --> 00:01:06.333
is not connected to the boundaries of scripture.

12
00:01:06.333 --> 00:01:09.541
Then Arjun asks out of curiosity –

13
00:01:09.541 --> 00:01:11.916
‘What kind of faith is this –

14
00:01:11.916 --> 00:01:15.250
sattvic, rajasic, or tamasic?’

15
00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:18.041
This very question becomes the foundation

16
00:01:18.041 --> 00:01:20.541
of the entire teaching of Chapter 17.

17
00:01:25.083 --> 00:01:29.666
Arjun's question is filled with
compassion and depth.

18
00:01:29.666 --> 00:01:30.833
He is not asking about those

19
00:01:30.833 --> 00:01:33.041
rebellious individuals

20
00:01:33.041 --> 00:01:34.250
who are driven only by

21
00:01:34.250 --> 00:01:36.583
selfishness and desires,

22
00:01:36.583 --> 00:01:40.166
who were described in Chapter 16.

23
00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:43.750
Here he is pointing toward those people

24
00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:47.000
who have faith, who also worship,

25
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:48.416
but whose practice

26
00:01:48.416 --> 00:01:51.000
is not according to scripture.

27
00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.958
Sometimes from family tradition, sometimes

28
00:01:53.958 --> 00:01:56.291
from regional customs, or sometimes

29
00:01:56.291 --> 00:01:57.875
from their own personal belief.

30
00:01:57.875 --> 00:02:01.000
People perform rituals, keep fasts,

31
00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:03.125
or pray,

32
00:02:03.125 --> 00:02:06.416
but their foundation is not scripture.

33
00:02:06.416 --> 00:02:10.291
In today's times this question
is even more relevant.

34
00:02:10.291 --> 00:02:13.375
Many people have a spiritual inclination,

35
00:02:13.375 --> 00:02:17.000
but the method of worship varies.

36
00:02:17.000 --> 00:02:19.958
Someone chants mantras heard
from grandparents,

37
00:02:19.958 --> 00:02:23.583
someone fasts according to popular belief,

38
00:02:23.583 --> 00:02:26.583
someone follows a traditional ritual –

39
00:02:26.583 --> 00:02:30.166
but on looking deeply, these actions of theirs

40
00:02:30.166 --> 00:02:33.250
do not have the guidance of scripture.

41
00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:36.250
Now here Arjun asks –

42
00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:40.500
is such faith helpful in spiritual progress?

43
00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:43.250
Can it reach higher knowledge,

44
00:02:43.250 --> 00:02:44.958
or does it get mixed with ignorance

45
00:02:44.958 --> 00:02:47.958
and attachment?

46
00:02:47.958 --> 00:02:49.666
Lord Krishna's answer is not

47
00:02:49.666 --> 00:02:51.708
merely in yes or no.

48
00:02:51.708 --> 00:02:56.833
He explains faith on the basis of
the three gunas – sattva, rajas,

49
00:02:56.833 --> 00:02:57.833
and tamas –

50
00:02:57.833 --> 00:03:02.666
that is, purity, restlessness, and ignorance.

51
00:03:02.666 --> 00:03:04.166
Just as everything in the world

52
00:03:04.166 --> 00:03:07.208
is influenced by these gunas,

53
00:03:07.208 --> 00:03:11.666
in the same way faith too takes
shape according to the gunas.

54
00:03:11.666 --> 00:03:14.291
The beauty of this perspective is that

55
00:03:14.291 --> 00:03:18.000
it is not rigid, but practical.

56
00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:20.875
Lord Krishna does not reject faith,

57
00:03:20.875 --> 00:03:22.500
but rather shows

58
00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:26.041
what its quality and its outcome are.

59
00:03:26.041 --> 00:03:29.750
This discussion gives us a deep teaching –

60
00:03:29.750 --> 00:03:32.166
that faith alone is not enough,

61
00:03:32.166 --> 00:03:34.250
direction is also necessary.

62
00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:35.791
Just as a traveller

63
00:03:35.791 --> 00:03:38.500
reaches the destination not merely

64
00:03:38.500 --> 00:03:40.958
by having fuel in the vehicle,

65
00:03:40.958 --> 00:03:43.375
but by receiving guidance to take the vehicle

66
00:03:43.375 --> 00:03:45.250
in the right direction,

67
00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:47.000
in the same way faith too

68
00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:50.583
needs the light of knowledge.

69
00:03:50.583 --> 00:03:53.000
After this, Lord Krishna will explain

70
00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:56.083
to us further – how the three forms of faith,

71
00:03:56.083 --> 00:03:57.750
sattvic, rajasic,

72
00:03:57.750 --> 00:04:01.125
and tamasic, can be recognised,

73
00:04:01.125 --> 00:04:02.208
and how

74
00:04:02.208 --> 00:04:03.875
a seeker, by grounding their devotion

75
00:04:03.875 --> 00:04:06.125
in sattva,

76
00:04:06.125 --> 00:04:10.958
can transcend and move toward
spiritual elevation.

77
00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:19.125
You may be full of faith in your practice,

78
00:04:19.125 --> 00:04:22.583
perhaps you worship every day too.

79
00:04:22.583 --> 00:04:24.041
But pause a little

80
00:04:24.041 --> 00:04:27.041
and ask yourself this question:

81
00:04:27.041 --> 00:04:30.000
where is this path taking me?

82
00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.416
Certainly, sincere feelings

83
00:04:32.416 --> 00:04:35.500
are a beautiful beginning, but if

84
00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:38.666
they do not receive the support
of right knowledge,

85
00:04:38.666 --> 00:04:41.583
then they only keep turning you in circles.

86
00:04:41.583 --> 00:04:44.583
They give comfort, but not clarity.

87
00:04:44.583 --> 00:04:49.000
Just as a traveller finds the right
destination not only

88
00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:54.208
through enthusiasm, but with the help of a map,

89
00:04:54.208 --> 00:04:57.250
in the same way your practice too

90
00:04:57.250 --> 00:05:00.666
needs the guidance of knowledge.

91
00:05:00.666 --> 00:05:04.125
Not everything that appears sacred

92
00:05:04.125 --> 00:05:07.208
lifts the soul higher.

93
00:05:07.208 --> 00:05:10.375
If the right understanding is not joined to it,

94
00:05:10.375 --> 00:05:14.583
then it remains only the outer
form of sacredness.

95
00:05:14.583 --> 00:05:18.625
I respect your faith,

96
00:05:18.625 --> 00:05:24.083
but I say to you – refine it further.

97
00:05:24.083 --> 00:05:27.291
Illuminate it with knowledge.

98
00:05:27.291 --> 00:05:30.583
When the heart connects with the
right understanding,

99
00:05:30.583 --> 00:05:31.916
then even the most

100
00:05:31.916 --> 00:05:36.208
ordinary action becomes a divine practice.

101
00:05:36.208 --> 00:05:37.833
It is devotion done

102
00:05:37.833 --> 00:05:42.833
with direction that transforms tradition.

103
00:05:42.833 --> 00:05:46.708
So do not only look at

104
00:05:46.708 --> 00:05:49.833
what you are doing.

105
00:05:49.833 --> 00:05:55.250
Also ask why you are doing it.

106
00:05:59.750 --> 00:06:04.208
We receive a great deal from our family.

107
00:06:04.208 --> 00:06:06.458
Rituals, festivals,

108
00:06:06.458 --> 00:06:10.500
samskaras, and traditions.

109
00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:13.541
But now think,

110
00:06:13.541 --> 00:06:16.541
are we also passing forward
the flame of knowledge

111
00:06:16.541 --> 00:06:19.000
along with them?

112
00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:21.041
Just a lamp is not enough,

113
00:06:21.041 --> 00:06:24.666
until its flame is burning.

114
00:06:24.666 --> 00:06:26.916
In the same way, traditions

115
00:06:26.916 --> 00:06:30.125
should live not merely as a show, but

116
00:06:30.125 --> 00:06:33.291
in a meaningful sense.

117
00:06:33.291 --> 00:06:38.125
Today many families follow tradition,

118
00:06:38.125 --> 00:06:41.375
but forget its purpose.

119
00:06:41.375 --> 00:06:46.250
The rituals continue, but the feeling is lost.

120
00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:47.750
Faith is visible,

121
00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:51.041
but understanding does not reach.

122
00:06:51.041 --> 00:06:56.458
I am not telling you to abandon tradition.

123
00:06:56.458 --> 00:06:57.875
I am telling you

124
00:06:57.875 --> 00:07:01.625
to revive it.

125
00:07:01.625 --> 00:07:03.583
Understand what

126
00:07:03.583 --> 00:07:08.333
you are doing, and why you are doing it.

127
00:07:08.333 --> 00:07:10.791
And most importantly,

128
00:07:10.791 --> 00:07:13.791
teach this same thing to the next generation.

129
00:07:13.791 --> 00:07:16.500
When children see you worship

130
00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:19.958
with faith and awareness,

131
00:07:19.958 --> 00:07:22.958
they will not rebel,

132
00:07:22.958 --> 00:07:25.208
but will express their questions

133
00:07:25.208 --> 00:07:27.791
with respect.

134
00:07:27.791 --> 00:07:32.916
Do not give your family only the
covering of tradition.

135
00:07:32.916 --> 00:07:34.541
Give them also the meaning

136
00:07:34.541 --> 00:07:38.541
and awareness hidden within it.

137
00:07:38.541 --> 00:07:41.208
A lamp is meaningful only

138
00:07:41.208 --> 00:07:44.875
when its flame stays lit.

139
00:07:49.375 --> 00:07:54.958
At the workplace we often do what feels easy.

140
00:07:54.958 --> 00:07:59.291
Our experience, our habit, or the way

141
00:07:59.291 --> 00:08:01.916
learned by watching others.

142
00:08:01.916 --> 00:08:05.708
But pause and think –

143
00:08:05.708 --> 00:08:07.666
is your work

144
00:08:07.666 --> 00:08:10.416
connected to right principles,

145
00:08:10.416 --> 00:08:15.041
or are you merely repeating an
old habit and giving it

146
00:08:15.041 --> 00:08:18.583
the name of confidence?

147
00:08:18.583 --> 00:08:20.708
Arjun asked –

148
00:08:20.708 --> 00:08:24.083
if the faithful worship without taking the path

149
00:08:24.083 --> 00:08:26.333
of scripture,

150
00:08:26.333 --> 00:08:29.458
will they progress or not?

151
00:08:29.458 --> 00:08:34.416
This same question applies to your work too.

152
00:08:34.416 --> 00:08:37.708
You may be hardworking, and enthusiastic too.

153
00:08:37.708 --> 00:08:41.125
But if your efforts are not based

154
00:08:41.125 --> 00:08:44.250
on discernment and principles,

155
00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:48.291
then their result will not be deep.

156
00:08:48.291 --> 00:08:52.083
For example, if an advertisement is made

157
00:08:52.083 --> 00:08:57.708
with the aim of increasing the
sale of children's toys,

158
00:08:57.708 --> 00:08:59.041
but the tender

159
00:08:59.041 --> 00:09:02.875
feelings of children are not kept in mind,

160
00:09:02.875 --> 00:09:07.541
then however much effort or money is spent,

161
00:09:07.541 --> 00:09:10.791
the expected result will not be achieved.

162
00:09:10.791 --> 00:09:14.666
Dedication alone is not enough,

163
00:09:14.666 --> 00:09:17.250
direction is also necessary.

164
00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:20.625
Sometimes what feels familiar

165
00:09:20.625 --> 00:09:24.666
can also become the greatest illusion.

166
00:09:24.666 --> 00:09:27.916
So have the courage to learn,

167
00:09:27.916 --> 00:09:31.208
to unlearn, and to learn again.

168
00:09:31.208 --> 00:09:34.333
Join your sincerity with discernment.

169
00:09:34.333 --> 00:09:36.583
Just as practice needs the guidance

170
00:09:36.583 --> 00:09:41.250
of scripture, in the same way work too

171
00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:45.375
needs the support of principles and
clear thinking.

172
00:09:45.375 --> 00:09:49.083
Do not do your work only with energy.

173
00:09:49.083 --> 00:09:53.541
Nourish it with clarity and discernment too.

174
00:09:53.541 --> 00:09:57.875
Only then does it become a practice,

175
00:09:57.875 --> 00:10:00.750
and only then does true progress begin.
